{
  "info": {
    "name": "Eventos API - Archivos en AWS S3",
    "description": "Colección mínima para demostrar los requisitos de S3. Ejecuta en orden. El token y el numeroResumen se guardan solos.\n\nAntes de empezar: levanta la API con S3_BUCKET y las credenciales de AWS Academy en tu .env.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "numeroResumen",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Lo llena 'Comprar entradas'"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Login y compra",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login cliente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@correo.cl\",\n  \"password\": \"ClaveSegura123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Comprar entradas Festival de Jazz (guarda numeroResumen)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/compras",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "compras"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crea la compra cuyo resumen se usará en todas las pruebas.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombreEvento\": \"Festival de Jazz\",\n  \"cantidad\": 2\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"numeroResumen\", pm.response.json().numeroResumen);",
                  "  console.log(\"numeroResumen =\", pm.response.json().numeroResumen);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Generar archivo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Generar archivo del resumen (.txt) - se descarga",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/compras/{{numeroResumen}}/resumen",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "compras",
                "{{numeroResumen}}",
                "resumen"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requisito 1. El microservicio genera el resumen .txt desde la compra y lo devuelve como archivo descargable. En Postman: flecha junto a Send -> 'Send and Download' y se guarda en tu computador. Este archivo queda solo en tu equipo, todavía NO está en S3.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Viene como archivo adjunto\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Disposition\")).to.include(\"attachment\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Subir a S3",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Subir resumen a S3 (se guarda solo en la carpeta {numero}/)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/compras/{{numeroResumen}}/resumen/s3",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "compras",
                "{{numeroResumen}}",
                "resumen",
                "s3"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requisito 2. No necesitas adjuntar nada: el servidor vuelve a generar el resumen desde la compra y lo guarda automáticamente en el bucket, en la carpeta con el número de la compra: {numero}/resumen-compra-{numero}.txt. En la respuesta revisa 'key' y 'carpeta', y después muéstralo en la consola de S3.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test(\"Queda en la carpeta del número de resumen\", () => {",
                  "  const n = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"numeroResumen\");",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().carpeta).to.eql(n + \"/\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Reemplazar en S3",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Reemplazar resumen en S3 (subir .txt corregido)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/compras/{{numeroResumen}}/resumen/s3",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "compras",
                "{{numeroResumen}}",
                "resumen",
                "s3"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requisito 3. Body -> form-data -> clave 'file' (tipo File): elige el .txt que descargaste y editaste. Se guarda con la MISMA clave, en la misma carpeta.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Selecciona el archivo .txt corregido"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Consultar y descargar",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consultar y descargar resumen desde S3",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/compras/{{numeroResumen}}/resumen/s3",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "compras",
                "{{numeroResumen}}",
                "resumen",
                "s3"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requisito 5. Busca el archivo en la carpeta {numero}/ del bucket. 'Send and Download' para guardarlo.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Viene como archivo adjunto\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Disposition\")).to.include(\"attachment\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Eliminar",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Eliminar resumen de S3",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/compras/{{numeroResumen}}/resumen/s3",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "compras",
                "{{numeroResumen}}",
                "resumen",
                "s3"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requisito 4. Valida que exista y lo borra. Responde 204.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 204\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar otra vez (valida existencia: espera 404)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/compras/{{numeroResumen}}/resumen/s3",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "compras",
                "{{numeroResumen}}",
                "resumen",
                "s3"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requisito 4. El archivo ya no existe: la API lo detecta con objectExists() y responde 404 (S3 por sí solo respondería éxito).",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 404\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Descargar después de borrar (espera 404)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/compras/{{numeroResumen}}/resumen/s3",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "compras",
                "{{numeroResumen}}",
                "resumen",
                "s3"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confirma que el archivo ya no está en S3.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 404\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}